  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Health Facilities Solar Electrification Project</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The goal is to provide solar energy power to private hospitals in Nigeria to ensure healthcare resilience.The project will provide solar energy power to private hospitals in peri-urban locations at a subsidized price with a payment schedule to stimulate healthcare recovery from COVID-19 pandemic. There will be a private hospital need assessment and power audit to determine the solar power installation, payment and monitoring.</narrative>
  </description>
